{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Cw6eUSY1XS1793164956.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案，在高等法院續審。</p><p></p><p>三名被告包括，蔡天鳳前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球及前大伯鄺港傑，各被控一項謀殺罪及一項阻止合法埋葬屍體罪。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI-1230_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267MydJpZ2Tk1793164953.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>上午繼續由西九龍重案組警員陳偉雄作供。他於2023年2月24日到龍尾村單位爆門入屋，發現蔡天鳳屍骸。封鎖現場後，他被指派為證物警員，戴上手套、口罩蒐證，包括將懷疑兇器的鎚放進證物袋。</p><p></p><p>辯方律師質疑，證人拿起鎚後，肉眼看不到血或人體組織，沒證據顯示該鎚曾用來襲擊人，「只是一個鎚」，不涉及任何罪案。證人不同意，亦稱自己搜查期間沒移動證物位置。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:59.204293+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.307051+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:25.238833+00:00","content_hash":"4f2d82e700462965974be45c939573306859ef031fe5177ceb4de534af37e683","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:59.204293+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}